      deck: 'Type: Modified standard deck\nNumber of Decks: 1\nJokers: Added for 4 players (2 jokers), 6 players (1 joker)\nCard removal: All twos removed (48 cards base)\nSpecial ranking: 5-4-3-A-K-Q-J-10-9-8-7-6 (high to low)',
      equipment: 'Standard 52-card deck\nScore sheet for tracking tribes\nTable space for voting pool',
